{"id":"hierher","lemma":"hierher","pos":"adv","rank":427,"glosses":["to here, here (to this place), hither"],"ipa":"/hiːɐ̯ˈheːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/De-hierher.ogg/De-hierher.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Warum kommen sie hierher?","en":"Why do they come here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757324","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to come"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null]},{"text":"Komm bald hierher.","en":"Come here soon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40149","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"soon"},null]},{"text":"Ich komme oft hierher.","en":"I come here often.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/699161","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"often"},null]},{"text":"Kommt er hierher?","en":"Does he come here?","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Warum kommst du hierher?","en":"Why do you come here?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}